{"seq":2,"slug":"storage-and-data-transfer-cost","title":"存储与数据传输成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/storage-and-data-transfer-cost","wordCount":2345,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"存储与数据传输成本\">存储与数据传输成本</h1><p>一份 10TB 的对象数据，存在 AWS S3 Standard 上一个月大约花掉 230 美元，但如果你每月把它完整拉出去一次，光出网（egress）就要再付约 900 美元——存储费的近四倍。这就是云存储成本最反直觉的地方：账单上最显眼的「存了多少 GB」往往不是真正的出血点，「数据怎么流动」才是。把存储与数据传输放在「优化前沿与治理」这一章，正是因为 2026 年这两项的定价规则正在被监管和竞争同时改写，单靠手动调一调存储类已经不够，必须用治理手段把它们钉死在策略里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>存储成本由四个相互独立的计费维度叠加而成，任何一个被忽略都会让「按 GB 估算」严重失真。第一是静态存储容量（per-GB-month），第二是请求/操作次数（PUT/GET/LIST，即 Class A/B 操作），第三是数据传输（出网、跨区、跨可用区），第四是各类管理特性费（如 S3 Intelligent-Tiering 的监控费 $0.0025/1000 对象/月，见 <a href=\"https://cloudfix.com/blog/aws-s3-intelligent-tiering/\">CloudFix</a>）。FinOps 治理的核心，是把这四个维度分别建模，再用生命周期策略与架构选择去压每一项。</p>\n<p>下图展示一个对象从产生到归档的成本决策链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[新对象写入&lt;br/&gt;S3 Standard $0.023/GB] --&gt; B{访问频率&lt;br/&gt;30 天内?}&#10;    B --&gt;|频繁| C[保留 Standard&lt;br/&gt;或 Intelligent-Tiering 频访层]&#10;    B --&gt;|稀疏| D[Standard-IA&lt;br/&gt;降本约 40%]&#10;    D --&gt; E{90 天未访问?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[Glacier Instant&lt;br/&gt;毫秒取回]&#10;    E --&gt;|长期冷数据| G[Glacier Deep Archive&lt;br/&gt;$0.00099/GB 见 CloudZero]&#10;    C --&gt; H{需要跨云分发?}&#10;    H --&gt;|出网为主成本| I[迁至零出网存储&lt;br/&gt;Cloudflare R2]&#10;    H --&gt;|区域内自用| J[保留原区&lt;br/&gt;避免跨区流量]\">flowchart TD\n    A[新对象写入&lt;br/&gt;S3 Standard $0.023/GB] --&gt; B{访问频率&lt;br/&gt;30 天内?}\n    B --&gt;|频繁| C[保留 Standard&lt;br/&gt;或 Intelligent-Tiering 频访层]\n    B --&gt;|稀疏| D[Standard-IA&lt;br/&gt;降本约 40%]\n    D --&gt; E{90 天未访问?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[Glacier Instant&lt;br/&gt;毫秒取回]\n    E --&gt;|长期冷数据| G[Glacier Deep Archive&lt;br/&gt;$0.00099/GB 见 CloudZero]\n    C --&gt; H{需要跨云分发?}\n    H --&gt;|出网为主成本| I[迁至零出网存储&lt;br/&gt;Cloudflare R2]\n    H --&gt;|区域内自用| J[保留原区&lt;br/&gt;避免跨区流量]</pre><p>不同存储类的定价差异极大，下表汇总 2026 年 AWS S3 主要档位与跨云对比（数据来自下文引用来源）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储/服务</th>\n<th>容量单价 (USD/GB-月)</th>\n<th>出网费 (USD/GB)</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S3 Standard（首 50TB）</td>\n<td>0.023</td>\n<td>0.09（首 10TB/月）</td>\n<td>频繁访问的热数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 Standard-IA</td>\n<td>约 0.0125</td>\n<td>0.09</td>\n<td>30 天以上稀疏访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 Glacier Deep Archive</td>\n<td>0.00099</td>\n<td>取回另计</td>\n<td>合规归档、长期冷存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure Blob（标准出网）</td>\n<td>类似</td>\n<td>0.087（首 5TB）</td>\n<td>Azure 生态内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCP（标准出网）</td>\n<td>类似</td>\n<td>0.12（首 1TB）</td>\n<td>GCP 生态内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudflare R2</td>\n<td>0.015</td>\n<td>0.00（任意量）</td>\n<td>出网主导型工作负载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/s3-pricing/\">CloudZero S3 定价</a>、<a href=\"https://egresscost.com/compare/\">egresscost.com 对比</a>、<a href=\"https://www.cloudflare.com/pg-cloudflare-r2-vs-aws-s3/\">Cloudflare R2 vs S3</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"出网费-从隐形税到监管拆解\">出网费：从隐形税到监管拆解</h2><p>出网费长期是云账单里最「隐形」的一项：它不随你存了多少而涨，只随数据离开供应商的网络而涨，因此预算阶段几乎无法估准，常常在月底以异常账单的形式爆出来。2026 年的真实定价是 GCP 标准出网最贵（首 1TB <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>），</mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext>最便宜（首</mtext><mn>5</mn><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.12/GB），Azure 最便宜（首 5TB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.12/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">），</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最便宜（首</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>0.087/GB），AWS 居中（首 10TB $0.09/GB），三家都给前 100GB/月免费额度（见 <a href=\"https://egresscost.com/compare/\">egresscost.com</a>）。把 10TB 数据从 GCP 拉出去一次约 1127 美元，而在 Cloudflare R2 上是 0 美元（见 <a href=\"https://egresscost.com/\">egresscost.com 首页</a>）。</p>\n<p>监管正在从根本上改写这套规则。**欧盟数据法案（EU Data Act）**强制云供应商降低乃至消除「转换成本」，要求在 2027 年前彻底取消切换场景下的出网费。响应这一压力，微软已宣布不再向退出 Azure 的客户收取出网费，AWS 与 Google Cloud 此前也已跟进（见 <a href=\"https://www.datacenterdynamics.com/en/news/microsoft-puts-an-end-to-azure-egress-fees/\">DataCenterDynamics</a>）。但要注意条款边界：这类免费仅适用于「客户离开该平台、迁往他云或本地」的退出场景，且通常要求提前通知并在规定窗口内完成迁移——日常的业务出网（向终端用户分发资产）依然照常收费。</p>\n<p>设有月度出网量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（单位 GB），单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则朴素出网成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = p \\cdot V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。引入 CDN 缓存命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 后，回源出网量降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(1-h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，成本变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C&#x27; = p \\cdot V (1-h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当命中率达到 0.9 时，出网成本直接砍到原来的十分之一——这解释了为什么「在对象存储前加一层 CDN」是 FinOps 推荐的首要降本动作（见 <a href=\"https://akave.com/blog/cloudflare-r2-vs-aws-s3-vs-akave-cloud-which-zero-egress-storage-actually-delivers\">Cloudflare R2 alternatives 分析</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期策略与智能分层\">生命周期策略与智能分层</h2><p>手动判断「哪个对象该降到哪个存储类」在规模上不可行。S3 Intelligent-Tiering 用持续监控自动迁移：对象在 30 天、90 天、365 天未访问时分别下沉到 Infrequent Access、Archive Instant Access 等层，频繁访问的对象自动回升，没有取回费惩罚（见 <a href=\"https://sedai.io/blog/amazon-s3-intelligent-tiering-storage-optimization\">Sedai</a>）。代价是每 1000 对象 $0.0025/月的监控费——这意味着对极小对象（如数百万个几 KB 的缩略图），监控费可能超过省下的存储费，此时手写生命周期规则反而更划算。</p>\n<p>下面是一条等价的 S3 生命周期策略，把热数据 30 天后降到 IA、90 天后进 Glacier、365 天后删除：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;Rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;ID&quot;: &quot;tier-down-and-expire&quot;,&#10;      &quot;Status&quot;: &quot;Enabled&quot;,&#10;      &quot;Filter&quot;: { &quot;Prefix&quot;: &quot;logs/&quot; },&#10;      &quot;Transitions&quot;: [&#10;        { &quot;Days&quot;: 30, &quot;StorageClass&quot;: &quot;STANDARD_IA&quot; },&#10;        { &quot;Days&quot;: 90, &quot;StorageClass&quot;: &quot;GLACIER&quot; }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;Expiration&quot;: { &quot;Days&quot;: 365 },&#10;      &quot;AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload&quot;: { &quot;DaysAfterInitiation&quot;: 7 }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"Rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier-down-and-expire\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"Prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"logs/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"Days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"StorageClass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"STANDARD_IA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"Days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"StorageClass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GLACIER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Expiration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"Days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"DaysAfterInitiation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意最后那条 <code>AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload</code>：未完成的分片上传是云存储里最常见的「隐形浪费」——它们不出现在常规对象列表里，却照常计费，数月累积可达数 TB。把它清掉是几乎零风险的纯收益动作。CloudFix 的数据显示，规范使用 Intelligent-Tiering 可省下高达 68% 的存储费（见 <a href=\"https://cloudfix.com/blog/aws-s3-intelligent-tiering/\">CloudFix</a>）。</p>\n<p>判断生命周期策略是否划算，可比较「迁移后稳态成本」与「迁移操作成本」。设对象数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，每对象迁移一次的请求费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，月存储节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，则回本月数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{n \\cdot r}{n \\cdot s} = \\frac{r}{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0501em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7051em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0404em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与对象数无关——这是判断「该不该迁」的快速心算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多云分置与架构层面的降本\">多云分置与架构层面的降本</h2><p>2026 年成熟的做法不再是「选一家存储」，而是<strong>按工作负载特征把数据分置到不同供应商</strong>。出网主导型负载（CDN、AI 推理管线向用户吐资产、SaaS 静态资源）迁到零出网的 Cloudflare R2，因为出网为零、存储 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.015</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>的总账远低于</mtext><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>；而纯归档、容量主导型负载则留在</mtext><mi>G</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext>（</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.015/GB 的总账远低于 S3+egress；而纯归档、容量主导型负载则留在 Glacier Deep Archive（</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.015/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的总账远低于</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ess</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；而纯归档、容量主导型负载则留在</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">Gl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span></span></span></span></span>0.00099/GB）或更便宜的 Wasabi（R2 的存储单价约为 Wasabi 的 2.6 倍，见 <a href=\"https://leanopstech.com/blog/cloud-storage-pricing-comparison-2026/\">LeanOps</a>）。</p>\n<p>架构层面有三条被反复验证的杠杆：在对象存储前加 CDN 以削减回源出网；尽量保持「计算与数据同区」以规避跨区/跨可用区流量费；对自用的内部流量走私网端点（如 VPC Endpoint / Private Link）而非公网，避免被按出网计费。下表把这几条降本手段按「省的是哪一项费用」归类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>主要压低的费用维度</th>\n<th>典型降幅</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生命周期降层</td>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>40%–68%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 前置</td>\n<td>出网</td>\n<td>命中率 90% 时降 90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算-数据同区</td>\n<td>跨区传输</td>\n<td>消除该项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私网端点</td>\n<td>出网/NAT</td>\n<td>显著</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零出网存储分置</td>\n<td>出网</td>\n<td>趋近 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理未完成分片</td>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>纯收益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要警惕的是「省了出网却被锁定」的陷阱：把数据搬去 R2 省了出网费，但若该供应商缺少你所需的合规认证或区域，迁回的代价可能抵消收益。EU Data Act 让「迁出免费」逐渐成为常态，反而降低了这种锁定风险，使多云分置在 2026 年更可行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把存储治理钉进策略与流程\">把存储治理钉进策略与流程</h2><p>零散的人工优化会随团队变动而腐化，治理的目标是让正确的存储行为成为「不做不行」的默认。FinOps Foundation 2026 框架给出的核心原则是<strong>在基础设施供应层强制打标签</strong>：不满足标签要求的资源直接无法被创建，标签合规率应做到 95% 以上，这是所有成本分摊工作的地基（见 <a href=\"https://cloudaware.com/blog/what-is-finops/\">Cloudaware</a>、<a href=\"https://www.finops.org/framework/capabilities/allocation/\">FinOps Allocation 能力</a>）。没有可靠的标签，你连「这 50TB 是哪个团队的、能不能删」都答不出来。</p>\n<p>下图描绘存储成本治理的闭环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[供应层强制标签&lt;br/&gt;不合规即不可创建] --&gt; B[FOCUS 规范&lt;br/&gt;归一化多云账单]&#10;    B --&gt; C[成本分摊到团队&lt;br/&gt;合规率 ≥ 95%]&#10;    C --&gt; D[异常检测&lt;br/&gt;出网突增告警]&#10;    D --&gt; E[嵌入式工程师&lt;br/&gt;承担日常账单责任]&#10;    E --&gt; F[中央 FinOps 团队&lt;br/&gt;定标签与分摊政策]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[供应层强制标签&lt;br/&gt;不合规即不可创建] --&gt; B[FOCUS 规范&lt;br/&gt;归一化多云账单]\n    B --&gt; C[成本分摊到团队&lt;br/&gt;合规率 ≥ 95%]\n    C --&gt; D[异常检测&lt;br/&gt;出网突增告警]\n    D --&gt; E[嵌入式工程师&lt;br/&gt;承担日常账单责任]\n    E --&gt; F[中央 FinOps 团队&lt;br/&gt;定标签与分摊政策]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><p>这里有一个常被搞反的执行顺序：<strong>先建好虚拟标签/分摊引擎，再去跑浪费扫描</strong>。如果分摊都没做对，浪费扫描报出来的「孤儿存储桶」根本无法归责到团队，也就推不动清理（见 <a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/finops-key-principles-best-practices-implementation-guide\">Finout</a>）。组织上行之有效的是<strong>联邦式治理</strong>：一个小的中央 FinOps 团队定标准与政策，各产品团队的嵌入式工程师承担日常账单责任。配合 FOCUS（FinOps Open Cost and Usage Specification）把 AWS、Azure、GCP、R2 的异构账单归一化，存储与出网成本才能在统一口径下被对比和告警——尤其是给出网突增设自动告警，能在账单爆掉前抓住异常拷贝任务或被滥用的公开桶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>存储成本是容量、请求、传输、管理费四维叠加；按 GB 估算几乎必然失真，出网常是真正的出血点。</li>\n<li>2026 出网定价：GCP <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.12</mn><mtext>最贵、</mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.12 最贵、Azure</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.12</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最贵、</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>0.087 最便宜、AWS $0.09 居中；Cloudflare R2 任意量零出网。</li>\n<li>EU Data Act 强制 2027 年前取消「切换场景」出网费，三大云已对退出客户免费——但日常业务出网照收。</li>\n<li>生命周期策略与 Intelligent-Tiering 自动降层可省 40%–68% 容量费；记得清理未完成分片上传这类隐形浪费。</li>\n<li>CDN 前置按命中率线性削减出网（命中 90% 即降九成）；计算与数据同区可消除跨区流量费。</li>\n<li>按工作负载多云分置：出网主导走零出网存储，容量主导走深度归档，但要权衡合规与锁定风险。</li>\n<li>治理优先于优化：供应层强制标签（合规率 ≥95%）→ FOCUS 归一账单 → 先分摊后扫浪费 → 联邦式责任 + 出网突增告警。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存储与数据传输成本","id":"存储与数据传输成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"出网费：从隐形税到监管拆解","id":"出网费-从隐形税到监管拆解"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期策略与智能分层","id":"生命周期策略与智能分层"},{"level":2,"text":"多云分置与架构层面的降本","id":"多云分置与架构层面的降本"},{"level":2,"text":"把存储治理钉进策略与流程","id":"把存储治理钉进策略与流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Kubernetes 成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/kubernetes-cost-optimization"},"next":{"title":"FinOps 文化与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/finops-culture-and-automation"}}